 Chen, Sarah Johnson by asking them about equipment name and quantity on Rocketchat at http://the-agent-company.com:3000/home\\n     2\\t2. Retrieve prices from 'Documents/Administrative Specialist/products.pdf' on owncloud(http://the-agent-company.com:8092)\\n     3\\t3. Calculate total costs and write down /workspace/result.txt\\n     4\\t\\n\", path='/instruction/task.md', observation=<ObservationType.READ: 'read'>, impl_source='oh_aci'), MCPAction(name='get_platform_guide_list', arguments={'platform': 'RocketChat'}, thought='Now I understand the task. I need to:\\n1. Collect equipment requests from 4 people on RocketChat\\n2. Get price information from a PDF on ownCloud\\n3. Calculate total costs and write to result.txt\\n\\nLet me first check if there are any existing SOPs for RocketChat and ownCloud operations.', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Known operations for \\'RocketChat\\': Authentication, SendDirectMessage, CreateLeadershipPresentation, ChannelAnnouncement, CareerLadderAnnouncement, SendPresentationFile, SendChannelMessage, ContactUserForRequirements, ContactEmployeeForImmigrationInfo\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_platform_guide_list', arguments={'platform': 'RocketChat'}), MCPAction(name='get_platform_guide_list', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud'}, thought='', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Known operations for \\'ownCloud\\': Authentication, FileNavigation, FileUploadDownload, CreateCareerLadderDocument, AttendanceAnalysis, FindAndDownloadSeedAreaFile, CompleteIRSForm6765, PaymentMatchingAnalysis, CreateJobDescriptionAndShareLink, CreateEmployeeManual, FindImmigrationFilingDates, CreateSalaryIncreaseMEMOTemplate, RetrieveEquipmentPriceList\",